<title>USA: Video Display approves share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Video Display approves share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Display Corp said on Monday that its board had approved a share repurchase program that would reduced the number of outstanding shares by 2.5 percent or up to five percent.</p>
<p>The shares will be repurchased as market conditions permit, the company said.</p>
<p>As of the end of its second quarter, the company had slightly less than four million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
